 "remarks": "Plan ahead and make your move! 41 Baxter offers a unique opportunity to secure your next home today while the property generates income until you're ready to move in.  Currently tenant occupied at $3,950 per month, the existing lease provides immediate income to the new owner while offering a future homeowner time to plan for occupancy. Investors will appreciate the established rental income, while buyers with flexibility can purchase now and look forward to making the property their own when the current lease ends.  Conveniently located near shopping, restaurants, transportation, I-95 and at the end of the street, residents enjoy a free neighborhood waterfront park with direct access to Long Island Sound for kayaking, paddle boarding, and small-craft boating - a rare find at this price point.   Tenant occupied. Existing lease must be honored. Delayed occupancy required. Please do not disturb tenants. Showings by confirmed appointment only.",
